{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/882076c47ca9052e73d9367de368a6c4.avif?t=1772846057\" width=1142 height=434 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, prosthetic bodies have become commonplace. Merrick is a purist in this age, refusing the strength of a mechanical form and clinging instead to his fragile biological body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why endure such suffering? Wouldn\u2019t freedom from disease, aging, and loss be within reach if we shed our flesh and embraced bodies of metal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Pulse is a story-driven puzzle adventure game. Explore a dazzling futuristic world and uncover the hidden truths behind its most powerful medical engineering corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story-driven game without any complex controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus entirely on the narrative and puzzles without worrying about complex mechanics. Easy to pick up, yet emotionally engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Charming 2D pixel art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, handcrafted art style that brings the futuristic world to life with warmth and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/9ea626d6d921d6bb2f332c72006cec1c.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/9ea626d6d921d6bb2f332c72006cec1c.avif?t=1772846057 width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/1d654727a4b59cd7810d2e860e93246c.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/1d654727a4b59cd7810d2e860e93246c.avif?t=1772846057 width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Narrative-integrated puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of puzzles that blend seamlessly with the story, revealing secrets and deepening your connection to the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/99b5556f21bfa468149f0842a80769f1.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/99b5556f21bfa468149f0842a80769f1.avif?t=1772846057 width=1600 height=904 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/e7d18c43f2cbf13248d740e6ef1f7af7.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/e7d18c43f2cbf13248d740e6ef1f7af7.avif?t=1772846057 width=1600 height=904 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Bunnies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter Zephy, an adorable floating bunny robot NPC who adds charm and whimsy to the futuristic setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/740fc72daf0792be940de5937b55c62a.avif?t=1772846057\" width=500 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/3b238e095c0a3308cc97283c85c30cab.avif?t=1772846057\" width=468 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Merrick Damon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A purist who values humanity above all else. Merrick is kind to humans and hybrids, but cold and dismissive toward robots and prosthetic humans. He believes there is no need to show courtesy to them, reserving his warmth only for those he considers truly human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/2f71cff5566de2f4223781aa05c6e2ea.avif?t=1772846057\" width=468 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aki</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm-hearted young <strong><u>man</u></strong> who treats everyone with kindness. Though he has lost his memory, his optimism endures. As a hybrid with a mechanical body from the neck down, he possesses sharp reflexes and strength, yet it is his compassion that defines him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/15b9e666feda0fee8cd69529b112b98f.avif?t=1772846057\" width=468 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zephy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multi-purpose housekeeping robot shaped like an adorable bunny. Zephy is both clever and irresistibly cute, turning chores into moments of delight. Smart, efficient, and endearing, Zephy is as much a companion as a helper.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355930?t=1772846057","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355930?t=1772846057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/78966b8fb6a166d966fe405c3f56c64a1bc878ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772846057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/78966b8fb6a166d966fe405c3f56c64a1bc878ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772846057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3355960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/882076c47ca9052e73d9367de368a6c4.avif?t=1772846057\" width=1142 height=434 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, prosthetic bodies have become commonplace. Merrick is a purist in this age, refusing the strength of a mechanical form and clinging instead to his fragile biological body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why endure such suffering? Wouldn\u2019t freedom from disease, aging, and loss be within reach if we shed our flesh and embraced bodies of metal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Pulse is a story-driven puzzle adventure game. Explore a dazzling futuristic world and uncover the hidden truths behind its most powerful medical engineering corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story-driven game without any complex controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus entirely on the narrative and puzzles without worrying about complex mechanics. Easy to pick up, yet emotionally engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Charming 2D pixel art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, handcrafted art style that brings the futuristic world to life with warmth and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/9ea626d6d921d6bb2f332c72006cec1c.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/9ea626d6d921d6bb2f332c72006cec1c.avif?t=1772846057 width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/1d654727a4b59cd7810d2e860e93246c.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/1d654727a4b59cd7810d2e860e93246c.avif?t=1772846057 width=1560 height=882 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Narrative-integrated puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a variety of puzzles that blend seamlessly with the story, revealing secrets and deepening your connection to the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/99b5556f21bfa468149f0842a80769f1.avif?t=1772846057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/99b5556f21bfa468149f0