71cff5566de2f4223781aa05c6e2ea.avif?t=1772846057\" width=468 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aki</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm-hearted young <strong><u>man</u></strong> who treats everyone with kindness. Though he has lost his memory, his optimism endures. As a hybrid with a mechanical body from the neck down, he possesses sharp reflexes and strength, yet it is his compassion that defines him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/15b9e666feda0fee8cd69529b112b98f.avif?t=1772846057\" width=468 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zephy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multi-purpose housekeeping robot shaped like an adorable bunny. Zephy is both clever and irresistibly cute, turning chores into moments of delight. Smart, efficient, and endearing, Zephy is as much a companion as a helper.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ZeroHP"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/dd606fa35d15e4ef511997775251ccca72e7502e/header.jpg?t=1772846057","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Mechanical Pulse","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<